func isTerminal(f *os.File) bool {
	// Check if file is a terminal (character device and isatty)
	// Use stat and mode char device check, plus attempt to get terminal size?
	// Simplified: if file is stdin and we can stat and it's char device, assume tty if size 0 and not pipe?
